      "Every tenant-owned primary and foreign key begins with the internal tenant UUID and every tenant-owned relation uses forced default-deny row-level security.",
      "Internal UUIDs and constrained source-scoped external identifiers retain distinct semantic types.",
      "Business occurrence and server recording instants remain distinct timezone-aware PostgreSQL values.",
      "Every scientific quantity links raw lexeme, raw value and unit, canonical value and UCUM unit, assay specification, method revision, qualifier, reference interval, detection limits, conversion rule, rounding rule, and mapping revision.",
